Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to put a plug\Nin for Dave in first rehab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:06.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think that we also have a\Nlot of young athletes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I think we have a lot of\Ngrowth in terms of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:09.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,families.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:10.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,We all have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:13.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the athletes are just\Nincredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,But the problem is, in\NFlorida, we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:18.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,have the indulgence of being\Nable to play all year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:18.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,round.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.48,0:00:21.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,And Dave is an expert and\Nsort of a scientist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.52,0:00:24.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,of trying to get people back\Nto their game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:26.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I always send him these\Ndifficult athletes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:30.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,and he's gotten back people\Nback to, you know, MLB
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:31.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,level,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,you know, these athletes\Nback to playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.06,0:00:36.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,and being recruited by\Nnational, international
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:37.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,superstars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.32,0:00:39.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,But I think the thing is is\Nthat we really have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:39.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,realize
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.88,0:00:43.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,that rehab science in these\Nsports is just as critical,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:44.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,probably maybe more critical
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:47.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,than even or as much of our\Nsurgical treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,You know, Tommy John\Nsurgery, rotator cuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:52.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,talk about tennis players,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:53.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,you talk about pickleball\Nplayers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:55.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,I mean, baseball players.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.04,0:00:57.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,And I think that I've sent\Nyou a lot of tough athletes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:01:00.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,I think you really enjoy\Nthose challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,I do, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,You find the science of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.40,0:01:04.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,And not every therapist does\Nthat, you know?
